        "sub_heading": "We’re not just a dev shop. As a Shopify Plus migration agency, we do it all:",
        "text": "<ul><li>Product, collection, and variant migration</li><li>Customer data and full order history</li><li>SEO migration (301 redirects, URLs, meta tags)</li><li>Content migration (pages, blogs, assets)</li><li>Shopify Payments, shipping, tax setup</li><li>CRM, ERP, or WMS integrations</li><li>International store setup for <strong>Shopify Plus internationalisation</strong></li><li>GA4, Meta Pixel, TikTok tracking migration</li><li>Custom theme design built for conversion</li><li>Custom checkout (Shopify Plus feature)</li><li>Post-launch testing and performance audit</li></ul><p>All work is done in-house - we never outsource. That’s why we’re one of the few <strong>Shopify Plus migration experts</strong> who can deliver results fast, without compromise.</p>",
