        "text": "<p>Most migration agencies outsource overseas. We don’t. Every line of code, every integration, every pixel built in-house by our local team. We know the quirks of platforms like <strong>Magento</strong>, <strong>WooCommerce</strong>, and <strong>BigCommerce</strong>, and we don’t just migrate. We <strong>improve</strong>.</p><p>Our goal isn’t just to move your store — it’s to <strong>rebuild it stronger</strong>, faster, and better suited for scale on Shopify Plus.</p><p>You’ll work with <strong>certified Shopify Plus experts in Australia</strong>, backed by 380+ store builds and a stack of real-world growth results. If you're looking for a <strong>Shopify Plus agency that gets it done without the fuss</strong>, that’s us.</p>",
